{"beat": 2, "name": "LET THEM BE WRONG", "text": "Here's the model. You watch the P&L. Revenue up, margin healthy, net positive, so the business is fine and the bank balance is a lagging copy of the P&L. When cash gets tight it's a surprise, and the explanation is always something else. A big PO. A slow payout. A bad month. It's a fair model, because over a long enough window the P&L and the bank do agree. The trouble is the window. Inside it, the money leaves on one set of dates and comes back on another, and the P&L doesn't carry dates.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "Here's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.29}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.313, "end": 0.383}, {"word": "model.", "start": 0.406, "end": 0.871}, {"word": "You", "start": 1.08, "end": 1.207}, {"word": "watch", "start": 1.265, "end": 1.474}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.521, "end": 1.591}, {"word": "P&L.", "start": 1.625, "end": 2.252}, {"word": "Revenue", "start": 2.531, "end": 2.949}, {"word": "up,", "start": 2.995, "end": 3.274}, {"word": "margin", "start": 3.355, "end": 3.727}, {"word": "healthy,", "start": 3.796, "end": 4.4}, {"word": "net", "start": 4.516, "end": 4.69}, {"word": "positive,", "start": 4.76, "end": 5.48}, {"word": "so", "start": 5.631, "end": 5.747}, {"word": "the", "start": 5.805, "end": 5.875}, {"word": "business", "start": 5.921, "end": 6.258}, {"word": "is", "start": 6.304, "end": 6.385}, {"word": "fine", "start": 6.467, "end": 6.861}, {"word": "and", "start": 6.908, "end": 7.024}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.07, "end": 7.14}, {"word": "bank", "start": 7.198, "end": 7.442}, {"word": "balance", "start": 7.512, "end": 7.872}, {"word": "is", "start": 7.906, "end": 7.988}, {"word": "a", "start": 8.069, "end": 8.104}, {"word": "lagging", "start": 8.197, "end": 8.603}, {"word": "copy", "start": 8.684, "end": 9.067}, {"word": "of", "start": 9.125, "end": 9.195}, {"word": "the", "start": 9.242, "end": 9.311}, {"word": "P&L.", "start": 9.346, "end": 9.985}, {"word": "When", "start": 10.1